AIDE1 = 'Is part of the set of constants used for computing the boundary directional spectrum. Allow the computation of the angular distribution function • 1 : cos2s (T − T 0) ; with T in [T0-pi/2;T0+pi/2] • 2 : exp(−0.5((T − T 0)/s)2 ) ; with T in [T0-pi/2;T0+pi/2] • 3 : cos2s ((T − T 0)/2) (of type Mitsuyasu) • 4 : Mitsuyasu with s = (F/ f p)5 or s = (F/ f p)−2.5 where s is the boundary directionnal spread (SPRE1L or SPRE2L) Related keywords: `TYPE OF BOUNDARY DIRECTIONAL SPECTRUM`.'
/
